r your own tax and insurance contributions. All with Evri Premium, a network of DHL. *Up to £1200 per week based on working 6 days at a competitive piece-rate, reflecting average daily earnings of £200 per day when delivering typical parcel volumes. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="Apply now" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="https://a599f30ac4a5e7debe3d4159fff14c.a5.environment.api.powerplatform.com/powerautomate/automations/direct/workflows/7817328d255b4651a004e57dd9c839d0/triggers/manual/paths/invoke?api-version=1&amp;sp=%2Ftriggers%2Fmanual%2Frun&amp;sv=1.0&amp;sig=79WlNkhnltNe8E653qmXEiX-fJ--mpThJ3PGWApjOxA" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Apply now<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><article class="article-link-item article-link-item--neutral" data-v-10a41d36 data-v-6b4a6e25><img src="{{ asset('images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9494a942.jpg') }}" srcset="https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9494.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=640 640w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9494.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=828 828w, https://images.prismic.io/ev-mercury/Z6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9494.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&amp;q=50&amp;fit=max&amp;width=1200 1200w" alt="A female van driver dressed in an Evri banded vest is loading a blue Evri van with parcels." width="7762" height="5177" class="article-link-item__image" loading="lazy" sizes="(min-width: 992px) 50vw, 100vw" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__content" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__text-block" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="e-label e-label--variant-brand-04 article-link-item__label" data-test-id="e-label" data-v-6b4a6e25 data-v-a0e028ea><span class="e-label__value--dark e-label__value" data-test-id="label-text" data-v-a0e028ea>Earn from 31K a year</span></div><!--[--><h3><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->Parcelshop Delivery Van Driver<!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></h3><!--]--><div class="article-link-item__description" data-v-6b4a6e25><!--[--><p><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--[--><!--v-if-->As a Parcelshop Delivery Van Driver, you&#39;ll be an Evri employee, with a vehicle provided. You will qualify for holiday, sick pay and pension. There are both full and part-time opportunities available. <!--]--><!--]--><!--]--><!--]--></p><!--]--></div></div><div class="article-link-item__cta" data-v-6b4a6e25><div class="article-link-item__buttons" data-v-6b4a6e25><a data-test-id="e-button" class="e-button e-button--type-secondary e-button--variant-1 e-button--icon-right e-button--link article-link-item__primary" data-gtm-track="Apply now" aria-disabled="false" aria-busy="false" href="https://jobs.dayforcehcm.com/en-GB/evri/CANDIDATEPORTAL?searchText=parcelshop" data-v-6b4a6e25 style="--v0f706b30:initial;--v57e477c2:initial;--cb28d334:initial;" data-v-a7b41470><!----><span data-test-id="e-button-text" class="e-button__slot-wrapper" data-v-a7b41470><!--[-->Apply now<!--]--></span></a><!----></div><!----></div></div></article><!--]--></div><!--]--></div></section><section id="evri-premium-van-driver-roles" class="landing-feature-banner landing-feature-banner--standard" data-slice-type="landing_feature_banner" data-slice-variation="fullWidthBanner" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__container" data-v-54256dfc><div class="landing-feature-banner__image-container--image-right landing-featur