n drivers to join Evri. With depots and hubs across the UK as well as self-employed and employed opportunities, you can find your perfect role with Evri.  ",[],"ltr",null,{"link_type":39},"Any",{"link_type":39},{"dimensions":42,"alt":45,"copyright":37,"url":46,"id":47,"edit":48},{"width":43,"height":44},300,83,"EVRi logo","become-a-van-driver.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002F9b833402-9f97-49d2-927c-6e19d3505ba2_evri.svg","YhYpMBIAAC8A0QBr",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},0,1,"transparent",{},{"link_type":18},"page_header$685be352-9a1d-4aca-9374-66032117e119","page_header",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":57,"primary":105,"id":113,"slice_type":114,"slice_label":37},[58,83],{"Title":59,"Description":64,"Image":68,"Label":76,"UrlText":77,"Url":78,"buttonDataGtmTrack":77,"SecondaryButtonText":37,"SecondaryButtonUrl":82,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":37,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[60],{"type":61,"text":62,"spans":63,"direction":36},"heading3","Self Employed Premium Van Driver",[],[65],{"type":33,"text":66,"spans":67,"direction":36},"Become a self-employed van driver; you'll need your own van and be responsible for your own tax and insurance contributions. All with Evri Premium, a network of DHL. *Up to £1200 per week based on working 6 days at a competitive piece-rate, reflecting average daily earnings of £200 per day when delivering typical parcel volumes. ",[],{"dimensions":69,"alt":72,"copyright":37,"url":73,"id":74,"edit":75},{"width":70,"height":71},1061,636,"A picture of a courier holding a box. He is wearing an Evri Premium DHL branded uniform.","become-a-van-driver.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCRWlidWJ-7kSDTu_EvriPremiumCourierMockup.png?auto=format,compress","aCRWlidWJ-7kSDTu",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"Earn up to £1,200 a week*","Apply now",{"link_type":79,"key":80,"url":81},"Web","0d4fdecc-3dca-43be-93bc-1ba25764eecc","become-a-van-driver.html\u002F\u002Fa599f30ac4a5e7debe3d4159fff14c.a5.environment.api.powerplatform.com\u002Fpowerautomate\u002Fautomations\u002Fdirect\u002Fworkflows\u002F7817328d255b4651a004e57dd9c839d0\u002Ftriggers\u002Fmanual\u002Fpaths\u002Finvoke?api-version=1&sp=%2Ftriggers%2Fmanual%2Frun&sv=1.0&sig=79WlNkhnltNe8E653qmXEiX-fJ--mpThJ3PGWApjOxA",{"link_type":39},{"Title":84,"Description":88,"Image":92,"Label":100,"UrlText":77,"Url":101,"buttonDataGtmTrack":77,"SecondaryButtonText":37,"SecondaryButtonUrl":104,"secondaryButtonDataGtmTrack":37,"ShowAppDownloadCta":20},[85],{"type":61,"text":86,"spans":87,"direction":36},"Parcelshop Delivery Van Driver",[],[89],{"type":33,"text":90,"spans":91,"direction":36},"As a Parcelshop Delivery Van Driver, you'll be an Evri employee, with a vehicle provided. You will qualify for holiday, sick pay and pension. There are both full and part-time opportunities available. ",[],{"dimensions":93,"alt":96,"copyright":37,"url":97,"id":98,"edit":99},{"width":94,"height":95},7762,5177,"A female van driver dressed in an Evri banded vest is loading a blue Evri van with parcels.","become-a-van-driver.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9494.jpg?auto=format,compress","Z6zAC5bqstJ9-iM8",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"Earn from 31K a year",{"link_type":79,"key":102,"url":103},"cc67c1a2-bb8b-47db-9ade-b2528c9f9e2b","become-a-van-driver.html\u002F\u002Fjobs.dayforcehcm.com\u002Fen-GB\u002Fevri\u002FCANDIDATEPORTAL?searchText=parcelshop",{"link_type":39},{"SectionTitle":106,"SectionDescription":111,"theme":112},[107],{"type":108,"text":109,"spans":110,"direction":36},"heading2","Compare our van driver roles",[],[],"neutral","article_link_module$f004f1cc-4ce8-47c8-9d1d-f3c448e33352","article_link_module",{"variation":116,"version":25,"items":117,"primary":118,"id":132,"slice_type":133,"slice_label":37},"fullWidthBanner",[],{"theme":29,"show_premium_logo":20,"label":37,"label_theme":119,"titleH2":120,"bodyText":121,"image":125,"rightImage":128,"buttonText":77,"buttonLink":129,"buttonDataGtmTrack":37,"primary_button_external":20,"button_secondary":131,"secondary_button_external":20},"Premium","Evri Premium van driver roles",[122],{"type":33,"text":123,"spans":124,"direction":36},"Evri Premium, a network of DHL, a brand-new delivery service powered by DHL, is looking for driven, motivated self-employed premium van drivers to join our growing team on a self-employed basis.  ",[],{"dimensions":126,"alt":72,"copyright":37,"url":73,"id":74,"edit":127},{"width":70,"height":71},{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},true,{"link_type":79,"key":130,"url":81},"01f3e79b-e5f5-4a3a-b6be-4df4c364c50f",{"link_type":39},"landing_feature_banner$88c9eddf-13dd-4682-b3c5-85284798de97","landing_feature_banner",{"variation":135,"version":25,"items":136,"primary":137,"id":165,"slice_type":166,"slice_label":37},"cardWithinSection",[],{"CardSectionTitle":37,"CardSectionText":138,"CardImage":139,"CardTitle":147,"CardText":148,"ButtonText":162,"ButtonUrl":163,"IsEco":20},[],{"dimensions":140,"alt":143,"copyright":37,"url":144,"id":145,"edit":146},{"width":141,"height":142},1000,666,"Evri Premium DHL branding","become-a-van-driver.html\u002F\u002Fev-mercury.cdn.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FaCR8jSdWJ-7kSEns_1000x666_commerce.svg","aCR8jSdWJ-7kSEns",{"x":49,"y":49,"zoom":50,"background":51},"What you need for this role:",[149,152,156,159],{"type":33,"text":150,"spans":151,"direction":36},"Our ideal self-employed van drivers are enthusiastic, hardworking individuals with a positive attitude and commitment to excellent customer service. To be eligible to apply for the role you need these three things: ",[],{"type":153,"text":154,"spans":155,"direction":36},"list-item","A valid UK driving licence ",[],{"type":153,"text":157,"spans":158,"direction":36},"Access to a large reliable van ",[],{"type":153,"text":160,"spans":161,"direction":36},"Previous experience in multi-drop delivery (desirable not essential.) Our van drivers are at the heart of everything we do.  ",[],"Apply for this role",{"link_type":79,"key":164,"url":81},"21bda84d-3bee-4515-88d1-d25cafa59745","card$863dbdab-17d9-4d7d-ae7a-5669a5c265d7","card",{"variation":168,"version":25,"items":169,"primary":185,"id":187,"slice_type":188,"slice_label":37},"listNoIcon",[170,173,176,179,182],{"title":171,"content":172,"isNumbered":128},"High earnings – top drivers earning up to £1200 a week",[],{"title":174,"content":175,"isNumbered":128},"Consistent work – regular routes and opportunities for flexible schedules",[],{"title":177,"content":178,"isNumbered":128},"Stability & growth – partner with a global leader investing in long-term success",[],{"title":180,"content":181,"isNumbered":128},"Customer connection – build relationships with regular customers for a more rewarding experience",[],{"title":183,"content":184,"isNumbered":128},"Flexibility – choose from 5-day, 6-day, seasonal, or ad hoc work – designed to fit your lifestyle",[],{"theme":29,"title":186,"description":37,"showPaddingTop":20},"Benefits of this role:","list_block$347c395b-83c6-45e4-b1c4-74d16165f03c","list_block",{"variation":190,"version":25,"items":191,"primary":193,"id":210,"slice_type":166,"slice_label":37},"cardWithImageNoCta",[192],{},{"CardImage":194,"CardAvatar":201,"CardTitle":202,"CardText":203,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":195,"alt":37,"copyright":37,"url":197,"id":198,"edit":199},{"width":141,"height":196},665,"become-a-van-driver.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ36cEJbqstJ99Lfa_20220725-EVRI-PeoplePhotography-292.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C5%2C6240%2C4150&w=1000&h=665","Z36cEJbqstJ99Lfa",{"x":49,"y":200,"zoom":50,"background":51},5,"none","Parcelshop Delivery Van Driver roles",[204,207],{"type":33,"text":205,"spans":206,"direction":36},"Our employed role of a Parcelshop Delivery Van Driver means delivering parcels on a multi-drop basis to our ParcelShop and smart Locker network. You’ll also be visiting local businesses to collect their weekly shipments, making you a core pillar of your community.  ",[],{"type":33,"text":208,"spans":209,"direction":36},"The role is consistent. Spending time in your van and working in your community. It’s also different as you’ll be building relationships with our Parcelshop partners and having conversations. Working flexibly, taking responsibility for your schedule and the decisions you make out on the road to meet our customers' demands.  ",[],"card$d30df186-73e2-4640-8038-84a857d6397c",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":212,"primary":214,"id":234,"slice_type":166,"slice_label":37},[213],{},{"CardImage":215,"CardAvatar":201,"CardTitle":147,"CardText":222,"ButtonText":77,"ButtonUrl":232,"IsEco":20},{"dimensions":216,"alt":217,"copyright":37,"url":218,"id":219,"edit":220},{"width":141,"height":196},"A female van driver dressed in an Evri branded hi-vis vest is sat in the cabin of her van. A pile of parcels is placed on the seat beside her.","become-a-van-driver.html\u002F\u002Fimages.prismic.io\u002Fev-mercury\u002FZ6zAVJbqstJ9-iNV_EVRI_LOCATION_06_9575.jpg?auto=format%2Ccompress&rect=0%2C8%2C8192%2C5448&w=1000&h=665","Z6zAVJbqstJ9-iNV",{"x":49,"y":221,"zoom":50,"background":51},8,[223,226,229],{"type":153,"text":224,"spans":225,"direction":36},"A full UK driving licence with 3.5 tonne entitlement and no more than 6 penalty points (new drivers are welcome but are required to do a short written and practical driving assessment.)  ",[],{"type":153,"text":227,"spans":228,"direction":36},"You will be a good communicator and focused on providing great customer service. ",[],{"type":153,"text":230,"spans":231,"direction":36},"Most importantly, you’ll bring a strong work ethic to get the job done. If you’re ready to get stuck in, we’d love to hear from you. ",[],{"link_type":79,"key":233,"url":103},"64942cad-d049-49e9-b749-e8f0cf62ca94","card$74f9ce78-de67-432b-aba2-51f04a3e5a61",{"variation":168,"version":25,"items":236,"primary":261,"id":263,"slice_type":188,"slice_label":37},[237,240,243,246,249,252,255,258],{"title":238,"content":239,"isNumbered":128},"Up to 24 days holiday, exclusive of bank holidays",[],{"title":241,"content":242,"isNumbered":128},"Opportunity to train with our driver academy for a fully funded HGV licence",[],{"title":244,"content":245,"isNumbered":128},"Health and well-being benefits and discounts",[],{"title":247,"content":248,"isNumbered":128},"Full and part time opportunities",[],{"title":250,"content":251,"isNumbered":128},"Opportunity for overtime",[],{"title":253,"content":254,"isNumbered":128},"Mental health support",[],{"title":256,"content":257,"isNumbered":128},"Great career progression",[],{"title":259,"content":260,"isNumbered":128},"Wagestream, access your salary early",[],{"theme":29,"title":262,"description":37,"showPaddingTop":20},"Benefits for this role:","list_block$766c22de-7cf8-4b77-aff5-f7b70aee33b8",{"variation":24,"version":25,"items":265,"primary":274,"id":276,"slice_type":277,"slice_label":37},[266,270],{"title":267,"content":37,"pillEnabled":20,"link":268,"dataGtmTrack":37},"Apply to be an Evri Premium self-employed van driver",{"link_type":79,"key":269,"url":81},"781e9dcf-8f08-421f-a6f2-afb4e2fe8f3d",{"title":271,"content":37,"pillEnabled":20,"link":272,"dataGtmTrack":37},"Apply to be an employed Parcelshop Delivery Van Driver",{"link_type":79,"key":273,"url":103},"d35c03b2-6b8d-4819-a321-16576889bd1a",{"sectionTitle":77,"sectionDescription":275,"pillEnabled":20,"showPaddingTop":20},"Evri is leading the way in creating responsible delivery experiences for everyone, everywhere. And we’re doing that by offering the most convenient way to send, receive and return parcels without costing the Earth.","feature_link_cards$e114d8ab-691b-4a1a-8ea1-7154cbb0e716","feature_link_cards",[23,56,115,134,167,189,211,235,264],["Reactive",280],{"$sglobal-feature-switches":281,"$sclients":347,"$sglobal-basket-count":37},{"abtasty":282,"accessibe":285,"appPromoBanner":288,"autoDivertUpdates":29